:: Bailey Halloween Mood [widget]
<<widget "gbaileyMood">><<if _args[0] gt 0>> | <span class="green">Mood +<<print _args[0]>></span><<elseif _args[0] lt 0>> | <span class="red">Mood <<print _args[0]>></span><</if>><</widget>>
<<widget "baileyHalloweenMood">><<set $bailey_gala.mood += _args[0]>><<gbaileyMood _args[0]>><</widget>>


:: Bailey Halloween Start
<<effects>><<endevent>>
<<npc Bailey>><<person1>>

A hand circles your arm from behind you. <span class="bailey-red">It's Bailey.</span>
<br><br>

<<He>> glares at you with barely contained anger.<<stress 6>><<gstress>>
<br><br>

"I'm running a fundraiser tonight. A charity gala for the orphanage," <<he>> says to you with a clipped tone, sneering. "Apparently you've been getting yourself talked about. <span class="pink"><<overworld_nickname "cap">></span>. That sound familiar? Donors specifically asked for your attendance."
<br><br>

<<His>> grip on your arm slackens.
<br><br>

"<span class="gold"><<ampm 19 00>></span> tonight. Will you be attending?" <<he>> asks you.
<br><br>

<<link [[Agree to go|Bailey Halloween Agree]]>><</link>><<glove "Bailey">>
<br>
<<link [[Refuse|Bailey Halloween Refuse]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Tell <<him>> you would never go anywhere with <<him>>|Bailey Halloween Never]]>><</link>><<llove "Bailey">><<gpain>>
<br>


:: Bailey Halloween Agree
<<effects>><<speechresolve>>
<<person1>>

<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"O-Okay. I'll be there," you say. "Uhm... What should I wear?"
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"I would be pleased to attend," you say. "What would be appropriate for the occasion?"
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	You nod. "I'll go. Tell me what you want me to wear."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	"I'll be there," you say. "What am I wearing?"
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty">>
	"Fine. Whatever," you say. "Do I have to put on something formal?"
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
	"I'll go," you say. "Make sure you give me something better than everyone else's costume."
<<else>>
	"I'll be there," you say. "What's the dress code?"
<</if>>
<br><br>

Bailey lets go of your arm. <<He>> seems somewhat surprised you said yes.
<br><br>

"It's a Halloween-themed fundraiser. Costumes are expected." <<He>> sounds annoyed by the whole event, despite being the one hosting it. "If you don't have a costume, put on something nice. <span class="bailey-red">Don't embarrass me.</span>"
<br><br>

<<He>> turns away from you.
<br><br>

"<span class="gold"><<ampm 19 00>></span>. My office." <<He>> reminds you, already stomping away. "Don't make me wait."<<npcincr Bailey love 1>><<set $bailey_love += 1>><<glove "Bailey">>
<<set $bailey_halloween_asked to Time.year>><<set $bailey_halloween_scheduled to Time.year>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Orphanage]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>


:: Bailey Halloween Pickup
<<effects>>
<<endevent>><<npc Bailey>><<person1>>
<<set _costume to getHalloweenCostume()>>

<<if _costume is "fully naked" or _costume is "exposed">>
	You step into Bailey's office. <<He>> waves a hand towards you dismissively, sneering.
	<br><br>

	"You stupid brat," <<he>> scoffs at you. "Go put some clothes on."
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Orphanage]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
<<elseif _costume is "none" and !($worn.upper.type.includes("formal") or $worn.lower.type.includes("formal"))>>
	<br><br>

	"If you're not going to wear a costume, then put something formal on," <<he>> says, pointing at the door. "Don't waste any more time. Go."
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Orphanage]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	Bailey looks up from <<his>> desk. <<He>> does not look like <<hes>> wearing a costume, but <<his>> clothes look finer than usual. You can tell from <<his>> stiff posture that <<hes>> annoyed to be doing this at all.
	<br><br>

	<<if Time.hour is 18>>
		"You're early. Good." 
	<<elseif Time.minute lte 14>>
		"You're on time." 
	<<else>>
		"We're almost late, you brat. Hurry up." 
	<</if>>
	<<if _costume is "none">>
		<<He>> looks you once over and nods sharply.
	<<else>>
		<<switch _costume>>
		<<case "vampire">><<He>> looks you once over with a sneer. "A blood sucking parasite? Suits you. You'll fit right in with the donors."
		<<case "witch">><<He>> looks you once over with <<his>> lips curled. "A witch. Of course."<<if $worn.head.name is "sage witch hat">> <<He>> regards your hat with a shake of <<his>> head. <<He>> flicks one of the flowers with <<his>> finger carelessly. "You sure know how to pick them."<</if>>
		<<case "scarecrow">><<He>> looks you once over, musing. "Trying to find your brain? Save yourself the trouble. Some things can't be found."
		<<case "mummy">><<He>> looks you once over with a flat look. "Cheap costume."
		<<case "skeleton">><<He>> glares at your exposed ribs. "They're going to think I don't feed you enough."
		<<case "futuresuit">><<He>> looks you once over. "Gaudy."
		<<case "pumpkin">><<He>> looks you once over. "I know a few customers eager to carve you open and turn you to pie."
		<<case "gothic">><<He>> looks you once over with a raised brow. "Looks expensive. Good."
		<<case "nun">><<He>> looks you once over with a sneer. "A habit. Fine enough. Remember to smile and look grateful."
		<<case "monk" "initiate">><<He>> looks you over with a sneer. "A monk. Fine enough. Remember to smile and look grateful."
		<<case "evangelist">><<He>> scoffs at you. "Spreading the good word? Go, then. Spread it to the donors tonight. Tell them about the orphanage. Make them cry."
		<<case "confessor">><<He>> gives you a cold look. "Don't let your god-bothering habits bleed into my gala."
		<<case "exorcist">><<He>> looks you once over, eyebrow raised. "Trying to clear this town of evil spirits? Good luck."
		<<case "sparring">><<He>> scoffs at your outfit. "What are you supposed to be, some kind of holy warrior? Save the fighting for when it pays."
		<<case "maid">><<He>> looks you once over, musing. "The donors will mistake you for help. Good. Make yourself useful."
		<<case "karate">><<He>> looks you once over, frowning. "Who exactly do you think you're fighting?"
		<<case "christmas">><<He>> looks you once over, sneering. "Wrong holiday. The donors will think you're slow. Works for me."
		<<case "gift wrap">><<He>> looks you once over, appraising. "Packaging yourself to sell. Bold. Saves me the trouble."
		<<case "cheerleader">><<He>> looks you once over. "A cheerleader. The donors will like it. Smile and wave. You know the drill."
		<<case "football">><<He>> looks you once over, sneering. "Do you even know how to play? Don't answer that. I don't care."
		<<case "belly dancer">><<He>> looks you once over, appraising. "Exotic. Good. The donors will spread their wallets for this."
		<<case "cowboy">><<He>> looks you once over with a flat look. "Dressing for the farm, are we? Fine. Grab a bucket. These donors don't milk themselves."
		<<case "riding">><<He>> looks you once over, musing. "Good. Riding is a useful skill to show off to these rich types."
		<<case "cow onesie">><<He>> looks you once over, sneering. "Cow pyjamas? You look ridiculous."
		<<case "prison">><<He>> gives you a cold look. "Do you want the donors to think I'm running a prison?"
		<<case "straightjacket">><<He>> gives you a cold look. "Do you want the donors to think you're broken in?"
		<<case "sailor">><<He>> looks you once over, assessing. "Dock work might suit you."
		<<case "nurse">><<He>> looks you once over with a flat look. "A nurse. Suits you. The donors will like it."
		<<case "rags">><<He>> frowns at your rags. "Cheap. You almost look like you did when I took you in."
		<<case "bride" "groom">><<He>> looks you once over, expression unreadable. "You clean up well, though you won't be finding your mate tonight."
		<<case "chef">><<He>> looks you once over and nods. "A chef, are you? You can help the catering staff when things get slow."
		<<case "swan">><<He>> looks you once over and nods. "Elegant. Try not to trip over yourself."
		<<case "butterfly">><<He>> looks you once over with a nod. "A butterfly. Let's see how long before someone pins you to a board."
		<<case "succubus">><<He>> looks you once over, musing. "Suits you. The donors will like this."
		<<case "vintage">><<He>> looks you once over, approving. "Looks expensive. Good."
		<<case "chain tunic">><<He>> looks you once over. "Armour. Sensible for this town. Just remember it won't help you tonight."
		<<case "eyepatch">><<He>> looks at your eyepatch. "A pirate. Good. Steal every pound you can from these people."
		<<case "medical eyepatch">><<He>> looks at your eyepatch. "Did you get yourself hurt? Stupid brat."
		<<case "gasmask">><<He>> looks at your gasmask. "Hiding your face from the donors? Fine."
		<<case "beret">><<He>> looks you over and scoffs. "Planning to be a revolutionary? Keep your little protests out of my gala tonight."
		<<default>><<He>> looks you once over. "What are you supposed to be? Don't answer that. I don't care. Stand straight."
		<</switch>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	"It'll do." Bailey says as <<he>> steps into your space. <<He>> reaches over and brushes dust from your shoulder before <<he>> clasps your shoulder tight enough to hurt. "Be on your best behaviour. <span class="bailey-red">There will be consequences otherwise.</span>"
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Get in the car|Bailey Halloween Drive To]]>><<set $bailey_halloween_attended to Time.year>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>


:: Bailey Halloween Refuse
<<effects>><<speechresolve>>
<<person1>>

<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"I-I'm sorry, I can't," you say. "I have other plans."
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"Thank you for the invitation, but I must decline," you say. "I already have plans."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	You take a step back. "I can't go. I'm sorry."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	"No," you say. "I have somewhere else to be."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty">>
	"No thanks," you say. "I'd rather do anything else."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
	You return the invitation to Bailey. "Find someone else to show off."
<<else>>
	"I can't," you say. "I have other things to do."
<</if>>
<br><br>

Bailey looks you over for a moment before <<he>> lets you go with a sigh.
<br><br>

"Fine. Works for me," <<he>> says. <<He>> stomps away, leaving you be.<<set $bailey_halloween_asked to Time.year>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Orphanage]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>


:: Bailey Halloween Never
<<effects>><<speechresolve>>
<<person1>>

<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	You retreat a step. "N-No. I would never go anywhere with you!"
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"I have no intention of accompanying you," you say. "Please stop asking."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	You shake your head without moving closer. "No. I won't go with you."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	You stand your ground. "I'm not going anywhere with you."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty">>
	"Are you kidding?" you say, crossing your arms. "As if I would go anywhere with you."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
	You step close enough to make the refusal impossible to miss. "I would rather walk into traffic than arrive beside you."
<<else>>
	"Why would I ever go anywhere with you?" you ask.
<</if>>
<br><br>

Bailey's grip around your arm tightens painfully. <<He>> gives you an unsettling glare.<<pain 1>><<gpain>>
<br><br>

"Useless brat," <<he>> sneers, letting go of your arm. <<Hes>> stomping away already. "Fine. Be that way."<<npcincr Bailey love -1>><<set $bailey_love -= 1>><<llove "Bailey">>
<<set $bailey_halloween_asked to Time.year>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Orphanage]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>


:: Bailey Halloween Drive To
<<effects>>
<<person1>>

Bailey walks ahead of you at a brisk pace. <<He>> leads you out of the orphanage and around the back to <<his>> car. Despite the festive mood, <<he>> seems annoyed and impatient.
<br><br>

"Get in," <<he>> demands, tapping <<his>> jacket pocket and gesturing towards <<his>> car once it lights up.
<br><br>

You get in the passenger side seat. Bailey gets in the driver's side and starts driving.
<br><br>

<<link [[Ask Bailey about <<his>> costume|Bailey Halloween Drive Costume]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Ask Bailey about the gala|Bailey Halloween Drive Gala]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Stay quiet|Bailey Halloween Drive Quiet]]>><</link>>
<br>


:: Bailey Halloween Drive Costume
<<effects>><<speechresolve>>
<<person1>>

<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"A-Aren't you going to dress up for Halloween?" you ask. "It's a rare chance to do so..."
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	You inspect Bailey's usual clothes. "May I ask why you chose not to wear a costume tonight?"
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	"You aren't dressing up?" you ask. "I thought we both had to."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	You point at Bailey's clothes. "Where's your costume?"
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty">>
	"Not dressing up even after you asked me to?" you ask. "So much for a Halloween gala."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
	You look Bailey over. "Did you forget your costume, or is this your best attempt?"
<<else>>
	"It's a Halloween gala, right?" you ask. "Why aren't you dressed up?"
<</if>>
<br><br>

Bailey is quiet for a moment, <<his>> eyes set on the road. <<He>> speaks flatly, "I am."
<br><br>

You look <<him>> up and down to try and guess <<his>> costume. <<He>> looks the same as <<he>> usually does when <<he>> conducts business, though <<his>> clothes might be slightly nicer than usual. <<He>> catches your eye in the rearview mirror and sighs. <<He>> opens <<his>> mouth, gesturing towards it with one hand before <<he>> places it back on the steering wheel. You stare at the odd sight of Bailey with <<his>> mouth hanging open until you realise <<hes>> wearing fangs.
<br><br>

<<if getHalloweenCostume() is "vampire">>
	"A vampire?" you ask. "Looks like we're matching."
<<else>>
	"A vampire?" you ask, surprised Bailey bothered dressing up for Halloween.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<He>> doesn't reply. <<He>> closes <<his>> jaw and keeps driving in silence. <<He>> looks annoyed.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Bailey Halloween Arrival]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
<br>


:: Bailey Halloween Drive Gala
<<effects>><<speechresolve>>
<<person1>>

<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"T-Tell me more about the gala," you say, breaking the silence. "Who's going to be there?"
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"Would you tell me more about tonight's gala?" you ask. "I would like to know whom we will be meeting."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	You wait for a quiet stretch of road. "Who will be at the gala? Is there anything I should know?"
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	"Tell me about the gala," you say. "Who matters, and who do I already know?"
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty">>
	"Aren't you going to tell me about this gala of yours?" you ask. "Is anyone I know going to be there?"
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
	You turn towards Bailey. "Give me the guest list. I want to know who deserves my time."
<<else>>
	"Tell me more about this charity gala," you say, breaking the silence. "What's the guest list like?"
<</if>>
<br><br>

Bailey's hand tightens around the wheel.
<br><br>

"The guest list is none of your concern," <<he>> says. "You were asked for by name this year. Just stand there and look pretty. Don't draw negative attention to my orphanage."
<br><br>

<<His>> eyes meet yours in the rearview mirror. "Your only job tonight is to not make a fool out of me. Don't fuck it up."
<br><br>

<<He>> says nothing for the rest of the drive.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Bailey Halloween Arrival]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
<br>


:: Bailey Halloween Drive Quiet
<<effects>>
<<person1>>

You decide it's best not to say anything when Bailey is already upset.
<br><br>

"You were asked for by name." Bailey suddenly says. <<His>> eyes meet yours in the rearview window. "Been making something of yourself, have you? Just don't draw negative attention to my orphanage."
<br><br>

<<He>> returns <<his>> eyes to the road, speaking coldly, "Your only job tonight is to not make a fool out of me. Don't fuck it up."
<br><br>

<<He>> says nothing for the rest of the drive.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Bailey Halloween Arrival]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
<br>


:: Bailey Halloween Arrival
<<effects>>
<<person1>>

You arrive at a venue on Danube Street. It looks to be a ballroom attached to a hotel. The sign on the front says "The Bailey Orphanage's Annual Halloween Charity Gala" in elegant print.
<br><br>

Bailey parks the car in a parking lot. <<His>> car stands out among all the fancier, less beat-up cars.
<br><br>

<<He>> rounds the car to your side and opens the door for you. The frown Bailey had been wearing the entire car ride has vanished. <<He>> smiles when <<he>> holds a hand out for you to take. It almost looks real.
<br><br>

"Remember," <<he>> says, quiet and low and just for you. "You will be on your best behaviour or you will pay."
<br><br>

<<link [[Take <<his>> hand|Bailey Halloween Arrival Take]]>><</link>><<handholdingvirginitywarning>><<NPCvirginitywarning "Bailey" "handholding">>
<br>
<<link [[Don't take <<his>> hand|Bailey Halloween Arrival Refuse]]>><</link>>
<br>


:: Bailey Halloween Arrival Take
<<effects>>
<<person1>>

You take <<his>> hand and <<he>> helps you out of the car seat.
<<if $player.virginity.handholding is true>>
<<if $stockholm_bailey gte 1>>
<span class="lewd">You feel elated holding Bailey's hand for the first time.</span><<arousal 500>><<garousal>>
<<else>>
<span class="red">You feel mortified holding Bailey's hand for the first time.</span><<stress 40>><<ggstress>>
<</if>><<takeNPCVirginity "Bailey" "handholding" "pc">><<if ($worn.hands.name isnot "naked")>> <span class="blue">Wearing $worn.hands.name, you can't quite feel <<his>> skin against yours. It doesn't count as your first time.</span><<else>><<takeVirginity "Bailey" "handholding">><</if>>
<</if>><<npcincr Bailey lust 3>><<glust "Bailey">><<npcincr Bailey love 1>><<set $bailey_love += 1>><<glove "Bailey">>
<br><br>

"Keep your mouth shut and smile, brat." <<He>> says to you, escorting you up the stairs.
<br><br>

By the time the two of you enter the ballroom, Bailey looks nothing but cordial and warm.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Bailey Halloween Ballroom]]>><<pass 15>><</link>>
<br>


:: Bailey Halloween Arrival Refuse
<<effects>>
<<person1>>

You refuse <<his>> hand. <<He>> goes still before pulling you to your feet by the arm instead.<<npcincr Bailey love -1>><<set $bailey_love -= 1>><<llove "Bailey">>
<br><br>

<<He>> leans in towards you. <<His>> smile has gone completely stiff.
<br><br>

"You will not act this way in front of the guests. Do you understand me?" <<He>> whispers to you with barely concealed anger. "Just keep your mouth shut and smile, brat. Even you can't fuck that up."
<br><br>

<<He>> lets go of your arm and walks with you up the stairs to the ballroom. By the time you're at the top of the stairs, Bailey looks nothing but cordial and warm.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Bailey Halloween Ballroom]]>><<pass 15>><</link>>
<br>


:: Bailey Halloween Ballroom
<<effects>>
<<endevent>>

The event hall is buzzing with activity. All around you are people in various costumes and dresses. Various staff weave in and out of the crowd carrying refreshments. You recognize some of them to be Bailey's goons.
<br><br>

<<generate1>><<person1>>A <<person>> immediately walks up to Bailey with open arms, greeting <<nnpc_him "Bailey">>.
<br><br>

"Bailey!" <<He>> says with a light and friendly tone. "There you are. I was wondering where our gracious host was!"
<br><br>

"It's good to see you." Bailey says to <<him>>, smiling warmly. "I'm glad you could spare the time."
<br><br>

The <<person1>><<person>> talks at Bailey while <<nnpc_he "Bailey">> nods politely. You slip away, but you notice Bailey glance your direction as you do so.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Bailey Halloween Gala Menu]]>><<set $bailey_gala to {mood: 0, cycle: 0, met: [], caught: false}>><</link>>
<br>


:: Bailey Halloween Gala Menu
<<if $bailey_gala is undefined>><<set $bailey_gala to {mood: 0, cycle: 0, met: [], caught: false}>><</if>>
<<if $bailey_gala.cycle gte 3>>
	<<include "Bailey Halloween Toast">>
<<else>>
<<effects>>

You're standing near the center of the ballroom. A picture of the Bailey Orphanage stands at the center of the far wall. Beneath it is a clear receptacle for donations and checks. <<if $bailey_gala.mood lt 0>>It looks sparse. It seems someone mistook it for a trash bin at some point.<<elseif $bailey_gala.mood is 0>>It looks sparse.<<elseif $bailey_gala.mood lte 1>>It's starting to fill up.<<else>>The box is filled to the brim.<</if>>
<br><br>

<<switch random(1, 4)>>
<<case 1>>Bailey is keeping an eye on you from afar while <<nnpc_he "Bailey">> works <<nnpc_his "Bailey">> way through the crowds.
<<case 2>>Bailey catches your eye before <<nnpc_he "Bailey">> turns to schmooze with a couple.
<<case 3>>Bailey is watching you intently from across the room.
<<case 4>><<endevent>><<generate1>><<person1>>Bailey's talking to a <<person>>. <<nnpc_His "Bailey">> eyes track your movement.
<</switch>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Interact with guests|Bailey Halloween Entertain]]>><<pass 20>><<set $bailey_gala.cycle += 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $bailey_gala.caught>>
	<span class="bailey-locked-option"><s class="disabled">Look for something to steal</s> <span class="bailey-red bailey-reveal">Bailey is watching.</span></span>
<<else>>
	<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 800>><<link [[Look for something to steal|Bailey Halloween Steal]]>><<pass 20>><</link>><<skulduggerydifficulty>>
<</if>>
<br>
<<link [[Stay quiet|Bailey Halloween Quiet]]>><<pass 20>><<set $bailey_gala.cycle += 1>><</link>>
<br>
<</if>>

:: Bailey Halloween Steal
<<effects>><<endevent>>
<<npc Bailey>><<person1>>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 800>>
<<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
	You make your way to the unattended coat check. You rummage through some pockets.
	<br><br>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	You pull out
	<<switch random(1, 4)>>
	<<case 1>> some loose cash.<<money 5000>>
	<<case 2>> a silver pocket watch.<<blackmoney 200>>
	<<case 3>> a condom.<<gcondoms 1>>
	<<case 4>> a vial of pepper spray.<<set $spraymax += 1>><<spray 5>><<gspraymax>>
	<</switch>>
	<br><br>

	You quickly tuck it away before you're caught. You walk away from the coat check at a leisurely pace.<<crimeUp 100 "thievery">>
	<br><br>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">A hand closes around your wrist.</span>
	<br><br>

	You look up, caught. <span class="bailey-red">It's Bailey.</span>
	<br><br>

	"You stupid little shit," <<he>> hisses at you, pulling you away from the coat rack behind an awning, away from eyes. <<Hes>> smiling at you and talking quietly, but you can tell <<hes>> furious. "What the hell do you think you're doing?"
	<br><br>

	You're about to say something when Bailey's hand comes up to silence you. <<His>> muscles are tense. <<He>> refrains from hitting you. The venue is too public.
	<br><br>

	"Shut it." Bailey shakes <<his>> head, lowering <<his>> hand. "You'll stay where I can see you."
	<br><br>

	<<He>> has to leave you to engage <<his>> guests, but you can tell <<hes>> watching you closer now. You won't be able to steal again.<<baileyHalloweenMood -2>><<npcincr Bailey love -1>><<set $bailey_love -= 1>><<llove "Bailey">><<set $bailey_gala.caught to true>><<baileyBrat 1 "gala_steal">>
	<br><br>
<</if>>
<<set $bailey_gala.cycle += 1>>

<<link [[Back to the gala|Bailey Halloween Gala Menu]]>><</link>>
<br>


:: Bailey Halloween Entertain
<<effects>>
