:: Bailey Halloween Quiet Flash
<<effects>>
<<person1>>
You look around the gala. No one seems to be looking at you. You move your $worn.lower.name aside and flash your <<bottom>> at the <<person>>.<<exhibitionism4>><<fameexhibitionism 2>>
<br><br>

<<His>> eyes go wide. <<He>> stares at you for a long time, transfixed.
<br><br>

"Thank you," <<he>> says, smirking wide enough to show teeth. "I'll make a generous donation to the orphanage on your behind... sorry, your <i>behalf</i>."<<baileyHalloweenMood 1>>
