:: Bailey Halloween Quiet Scene
<<effects>><<speechresolve>>
<<person1>>

<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	You back away and raise both hands between you. "Please leave me alone! Get away from me!"
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	You step out of <<his>> reach. "Your attention is unwanted. Leave me alone."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	You pull your arms against your body. "Please stop. I want to go back inside."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	You knock <<his>> hand away. "Back off. Now."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty">>
	"Get away from me, you pervert!" you shout.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
	You seize <<his>> wrist and twist until <<he>> steps back. "Touch me again and I'll break it."
<<else>>
	"Leave me alone!"
<</if>>

You raise your voice. You tell the <<person>>, loud enough to carry, exactly where <<he>> can put <<his>> donation.
<br><br>

Heads turn. The <<person>> lifts <<his>> hands and backs off, but the damage is done. Guests are staring. Across the room, Bailey's jaw sets. You've made a scene at <<his>> gala.<<baileyHalloweenMood -1>><<baileyBrat 1 "gala_scene">>
<br><br>
<<link [[Back to the gala|Bailey Halloween Gala Menu]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>


