:: Bailey Halloween Toast
<<effects>>
<<endevent>>
<<npc Bailey>><<person1>><<generate2>><<person2>>
A <<person>> clinks a fork to <<his>> champagne glass, clearly inebriated. <<He>> smiles and gestures at Bailey once <<hes>> gathered the room's attention. "A toast! A toast from our generous caretaker!"
<br><br>

You see annoyance flash past Bailey's face before it's smoothed over. <<person1>><<He>> raises a flute of <<his>> own and waits for the applause to die before speaking. "Thank you for coming, everyone. It's all because of your kindness that we can continue to provide for the orphans."
<br><br>

<<person2>>The <<person>> already seems bored by Bailey's speech. <<He>> gazes across the room and makes eye contact with you and interrupts, "Oh, enough of that. We've heard all of that before. How about we let one of the orphans speak?"
<br><br>

Bailey's smile twitches at the corner. The room turns to you. <<person1>><<He>> looks at you, jaw tight.
<br><br>

<<link [[Toast to the orphanage|Bailey Halloween Toast Orphanage]]>><</link>><<englishdifficulty 1 600>><<gbaileyMood 1>><<glove "Bailey">><<if !$stockholm_points.halloween>><<gbaileystock>><</if>>
<br>
<<link [[Toast to Bailey|Bailey Halloween Toast Bailey]]>><</link>><<englishdifficulty 1 600>><<gbaileyMood 1>><<gglove "Bailey">><<if !$stockholm_points.halloween>><<gbaileystock>><</if>>
<br>
<<link [[Toast to yourself|Bailey Halloween Toast Self]]>><</link>><<englishdifficulty 1 600>><<gbaileyMood 1>>
<br>
<<link [[Stay quiet|Bailey Halloween Toast Defer]]>><</link>>
<br>


:: Bailey Halloween Toast Orphanage
<<effects>><<speechresolve>>
<<person1>>
<<if $englishSuccess>>
	You stand up and raise your glass. <span class="green">You praise the orphanage.</span>
	<br><br>
	<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
		"I... I grew up at the Bailey Orphanage," you begin. "I wouldn't be where I am today without them..."
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
		"Please raise your glasses to the Bailey Orphanage," you begin. "It gave me the chance to stand before you tonight..."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
		You hold the glass close to your chest. "The orphanage fed me, housed me, and taught me to work..."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
		"I grew up in the Bailey Orphanage," you begin. "Everything I achieved started there..."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty">>
		"The Bailey Orphanage made me who I am," you begin. "I am standing here today because of them..."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
		"The Bailey Orphanage teaches children to survive," you begin. "You learn quickly when nobody accepts failure..."
	<<else>>
		"I learned everything I know today from the Bailey Orphanage," you begin. "I wouldn't be standing here without it..."
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	You speak about the beds, the meals, and the work put in that keeps it standing. You talk about how you and Robin grew up in the youth ward. You keep your toast warm and grateful.
	<br><br>
	The donors nod along, and a few of them clap. Across the room, Bailey watches you with a tight smile.
	<<baileyHalloweenMood 1>><<npcincr Bailey love 1>><<set $bailey_love += 1>><<glove "Bailey">><<if !$stockholm_points.halloween>><<set $stockholm_points.halloween to true>><<set $stockholm_bailey += 1>><<gbaileystock>><</if>>
<<else>>
	You raise your glass, <span class="red">but you fail to come up with anything to say</span>. You trail off. The mood dies. <<baileyHalloweenMood -1>>
	<br><br>
	Bailey finishes toasting the room, ignoring you.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Bailey Halloween Bailey Dance]]>><<pass 15>><</link>>
<br>


