:: Bailey Halloween Toast Self
<<effects>><<speechresolve>>
<<person1>>
<<if $englishSuccess>>
You raise your glass and <span class="green">toast yourself</span>.
<br><br>
<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"I... I don't really know what to say," you begin, "except that I'm an orphan and I'm here..."
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"Since you asked to hear from an orphan, allow me to toast how far I have come," you begin. "I hope my success earns your support..."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	You hold your glass up with an unsteady hand. "I worked hard to be here tonight. I hope that is enough to deserve a toast..."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	"A toast to me," you begin. "I came from the youth ward, and now this entire room is listening..."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty">>
	"Let's be honest," you begin, "you all came to see me the orphan of the hour tonight..."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
	You lift your glass above the donors. "To the orphan who earned a place in this room while the rest of you only paid for one..."
<<else>>
	"A toast to me, then," you begin. "It's hard out there for an orphan..."
<</if>>
